OL,2,W//%*// //%Q % -,*,%%** %-.*,$-.*,%,. (,
OL,3,AWhatsApp introduces optional parental
OL,4,Acontrols for teenagers
OL,5,
OL,6,FIn a blog post, WhatsApp, clarified
OL,7,Fparents would not be given the power to
OL,8,Fsee the messages their teen is sending
OL,9,Fand receiving, which along with calls
OL,10,Fwould stay private and protected by
OL,11,Fend-to-end encryption.
OL,13,FAnd it said the controls were optional,
OL,14,Fwhich social media analyst Matt Navarra
OL,15,Fcalled an "obvious weakness".
OL,23,APub: 30-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG6/19
