OL,3,ALady A singer Charles Kelley reveals
OL,4,Ablood cancer diagnosis
OL,5,
OL,6,FSharing a health update on Instagram in
OL,7,Fa video alongside his wife Cassie,
OL,8,FKelley announced he had been diagnosed
OL,9,Fwith multiple myeloma - a type of blood
OL,10,Fcancer that affects the bones and
OL,11,Fdifferent parts of the body.
OL,23,APub: 30-SepQpppppppppppppppppppppG15/19
